ext2 - root and data filesystem

DESCRIPTION
    The install image contains the BIOS loader and an ext2 root
    partition. The kernel can attach that partition on ATA or AHCI
    storage. The loader can also supply a temporary RAM copy.

    An optional separate ext2 data volume mounts at /ext2 when that
    directory is empty. A dirty root volume needs offline repair
    before boot. A dirty data volume opens read-only.

FILES
    /       Root filesystem.
    /ext2   Optional secondary disk.

SEE ALSO
    ls(1), poweroff(1), reboot(1), mmap(2)
